  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Cut sweet potato, carrot and capsicum into bite sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Remove from oven and allow to cool slightly.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84d110d0527cba53ac2f0/step-e3606700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a second medium bowl, combine Mumbai spice blend and a drizzle of olive oil. Add haloumi and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84d110d0527cba53ac2f0/step-f5070a10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook remaining garlic until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a small heatproof bowl.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt to garlic oil mixture and combine. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84d110d0527cba53ac2f0/step-3c722520.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84d110d0527cba53ac2f0/step-ffd95930.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To the tray with roasted veggies, add baby spinach leaves and golden goddess dressing. Season and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84d110d0527cba53ac2f0/step-9192b940.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie toss between plates.\n• Top with Mumbai haloumi and garlic yoghurt.\n• Sprinkle over flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84d110d0527cba53ac2f0/step-2245a750.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
